2. Definitions. - In these rules,-
(a)
'Court' means any Criminal Court in the State;
(b)
'Officer' means a Presiding Officer of a Criminal Court;
(c)
'person' means persons who attends any Criminal Court as complainant or witness;
(d)
'Schedule' means the schedule to these rules.
